    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" id=\"who\" aria-labelledby=\"h-52\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-52\">Medical SEO for <span class=\"accent\">every kind of practice</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Each type of practice has its own searches and rules.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs tabs--pills\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Practice types\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-53-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"tabs-53-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\">Clinics</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-53-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"tabs-53-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\">Dental</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-53-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"tabs-53-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\">Specialists</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-53-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"tabs-53-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\">Health brands</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panels\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--wide\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-53-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-53-tab-0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Clinics and medical centres</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Treatment pages, doctor profiles and local SEO for each location, so patients find the right clinic and book.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Treatment and condition pages</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Doctor profiles with credentials</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Local SEO for every location</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Google Maps · “dentist near me”</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>dentist near me</div><svg class=\"mk-map\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Map with business pins\"><rect width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ece8e1\"/><path d=\"M0 60 C120 50 200 90 400 70\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"10\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M60 0 C80 90 140 140 120 200\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"8\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M0 150 C150 160 260 130 400 170\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"7\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M280 0 L300 200\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"140\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d7ecd9\"/><rect x=\"310\" y=\"20\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d7ecd9\"/><g transform=\"translate(150 70)\"><path d=\"M0 0c-9-13-13-19-13-25a13 13 0 0 1 26 0c0 6-4 12-13 25z\" fill=\"#8f2cf4\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"-21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700\">★</text></g><g transform=\"translate(250 120)\"><path d=\"M0 0c-9-13-13-19-13-25a13 13 0 0 1 26 0c0 6-4 12-13 25z\" fill=\"#c43a5a\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"-21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700\">2</text></g><g transform=\"translate(90 140)\"><path d=\"M0 0c-9-13-13-19-13-25a13 13 0 0 1 26 0c0 6-4 12-13 25z\" fill=\"#c43a5a\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"-21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700\">3</text></g></svg><div class=\"mk-place mk-place--you\"><div><p class=\"mk-place__name\">Your Business</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><b>4.9</b> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> (312) · Dentist</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Open · Closes 7 pm</p></div><div class=\"mk-place__btns\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-browser\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-pin\"/></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"mk-place\"><div><p class=\"mk-place__name\">Competitor Dental</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><b>4.6</b> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> (128) · Dentist</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Open · Closes 6 pm</p></div><div class=\"mk-place__btns\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-browser\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-pin\"/></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"mk-place\"><div><p class=\"mk-place__name\">Another Clinic</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><b>4.4</b> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> (86) · Dentist</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Closed · Opens 9 am</p></div><div class=\"mk-place__btns\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-browser\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-pin\"/></svg></span></div></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--wide\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-53-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-53-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Dental SEO</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dental patients compare prices, reviews and locations. We build pages for each treatment and help you win the map pack.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Treatment pages: implants, aligners, whitening</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Reviews and before-and-after galleries</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Emergency dentist searches</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Reviews · Google</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-stats mock-stats--3\"><div class=\"mock-stat mock-stat--violet\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Average rating</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">4.9</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ from 4.2</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">New reviews / month</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">38</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +29</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Reply rate</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">100%</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ from 12%</span></div></div><div class=\"mk-review\"><div class=\"mk-review__head\"><span class=\"mk-avatar\">S</span><div><p class=\"mk-review__name\">Sara K.</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> · 2 days ago</p></div></div><p>Friendly team and spotless clinic. They explained every step and the price upfront.</p><p class=\"mk-review__reply\"><b>Response from the owner</b> Thank you, we’re glad the visit went well!</p></div><div class=\"mk-review\"><div class=\"mk-review__head\"><span class=\"mk-avatar\">O</span><div><p class=\"mk-review__name\">Omar H.</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> · 1 week ago</p></div></div><p>Booked online the same day. No waiting, and the follow-up call was a nice touch.</p><p class=\"mk-review__reply\"><b>Response from the owner</b> Thank you, we’re glad the visit went well!</p></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--wide\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-53-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-53-tab-2\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Specialist practices</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Dermatology, physiotherapy, fertility, cosmetic and more. We match content to the questions patients ask before they choose.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Condition and procedure guides</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Cost and recovery FAQs</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Referral and enquiry tracking</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Patient questions · Example</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-scroll\"><table class=\"mock-table\"><thead><tr><th>Question</th><th class=\"num\">Searches</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>how long does physio take to work</td><td class=\"num\">1,300</td></tr><tr><td>laser hair removal cost</td><td class=\"num\">6,600</td></tr><tr><td>ivf success rates by age</td><td class=\"num\">2,900</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--wide\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-53-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-53-tab-3\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Health and wellness brands</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Supplements, devices and digital health services need careful claims and strong trust signals to rank.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Product and category pages</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Evidence-led content</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Claims reviewed before publishing</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><div class=\"wf-hero\"><p class=\"wf-kicker\">Shop › Women › Supplements</p><p class=\"wf-title\">Women’s supplements</p><span class=\"wf-line\"></span><span class=\"wf-line wf-line--short\"></span></div><div class=\"mk-filters\"><span>Frame shape ▾</span><span>Colour ▾</span><span>Price ▾</span><span>Polarised</span></div><div class=\"mk-products\"><div class=\"mk-product\"><span class=\"mk-product__img\" style=\"--h:270\"></span><p class=\"mk-product__name\">Aviator Gold</p><p class=\"mk-product__price\">$189</p></div><div class=\"mk-product\"><span class=\"mk-product__img\" style=\"--h:30\"></span><p class=\"mk-product__name\">Round Tortoise</p><p class=\"mk-product__price\">$159</p></div><div class=\"mk-product\"><span class=\"mk-product__img\" style=\"--h:300\"></span><p class=\"mk-product__name\">Cat-eye Black</p><p class=\"mk-product__price\">$175</p></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
